    "headline": "Flutter Stock Falls After CEO Steps Down as Earnings Miss Expectations",
    "summary": "Shares of  Flutter  Entertainment were falling ahead of the open Wednesday after the company reported mixed second-quarter earnings and CEO Peter Jackson announced his resignation.  Dan Taylor, Flutter’s current international CEO, will take over at the end of the quarter.  The earnings figure missed Wall Street estimates of 54 cents, while the revenue beat estimates from analysts surveyed by FactSet of  $4.24 billion.",
